      "updated_at": "2026-09-22T08:14:17.151341+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-41fc8ea0132b",
      "replay_time": "2026-08-07 09:56:00 EDT",
      "text": "這邊看Bear Bo有沒有成功沒有的話可以做反向BO",
      "created_at": "2026-09-22T08:15:14.046180+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-22T08:15:14.046188+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-4efd647d83fe",
      "replay_time": "2026-08-07 10:04:00 EDT",
      "text": "BO成功 先拿TR 1R",
      "created_at": "2026-09-22T08:16:07.298629+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-22T08:16:07.298638+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-7b85bb582b17",
      "replay_time": "2026-08-07 10:19:00 EDT",
      "text": "1R 附近波幅其實有可能已經達到\n出現超大陽線反轉，可以用Long Limit 賭會拿到上半區\n差一點成交",
      "created_at": "2026-09-22T08:17:35.980777+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-22T08:19:31.961881+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-021661e7031f",
      "replay_time": "2026-08-07 11:09:00 EDT",
      "text": "可能中半區整理等12點",
      "created_at": "2026-09-22T08:19:18.878720+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-22T08:19:18.878728+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-3329309b5f55",
      "replay_time": "2026-08-07 11:39:00 EDT",
      "text": "多方很強 下半場應該上半區整理或是 緩步墊高",
      "created_at": "2026-09-22T08:20:24.842853+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-22T08:20:24.842862+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-95faa429cb7b",
      "replay_time": "2026-08-07 12:28:00 EDT",
      "text": "下1/3或是前低Long Limit賭上半區整理",
      "created_at": "2026-09-22T08:21:35.484431+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-22T08:21:35.484440+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-b94aebfbabfd",
      "replay_time": "2026-08-07 15:05:00 EDT",
      "text": "沒拿到前高或上1/3 快收盤在TTR高點附近小贏離場",
      "created_at": "2026-09-22T08:24:14.828798+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-22T08:24:14.828805+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-307182a22e86",
